Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
ehthumbs.db
ehthumbs_vista.db
*.stackdump
[Dd]esktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.lnk

# Linux
*~
.fuse_hidden*
.directory
.Trash-*
.nfs*

